rgistic prostate cancer suppression by anatomically discrete pomegranate fractions</article-title><source>Invest New Drugs</source><year>2005</year><volume>23</volume><fpage>11</fpage><lpage>20</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15528976</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1023/B:DRUG.0000047101.02178.07</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B22"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Liu</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Chen</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Lin</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Tsai</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Liang</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Inhibition of melanoma growth and metastasis by combination with (-)-epigallocatechin-3-gallate and dacarbazine in mice</article-title><source>J Cell Biochem</source><year>2001</year><volume>83</volume><fpage>631</fpage><lpage>42</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11746506</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/jcb.1261</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B23"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Heber</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Phytochemicals beyond Antioxidation</article-title><source>J Nutr</source><year>2004</year><volume>134</volume><fpage>3175S</fpage><lpage>3176</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15514294</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B24"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Mouat</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Kolli</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Orlando</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Hargrove</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Grider</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The effects of quercetin on SW480 hum